{% extends "_base.html.j2" %}
{% set theme = "sovereign" %}
{% set kicker = "// CANARY PATH FAILING" %}
{% set headline = "Synthetic Transfer Path Down" %}
{% block body %}
<p>The canary monitoring system detected sustained failures on a production transfer path. Synthetic transfers are firing, but the expected event chain is not completing within SLO.</p>
{% with rows=[
  ('Path', path),
  ('Backend', backend),
  ('Failure rate', failure_rate),
  ('Window', window),
  ('Detected at', detected_at),
  ('Last failure', last_failure_type),
  ('Sample test_id', sample_test_id)
] %}{% include '_partials/data_table.html' %}{% endwith %}
{% with cta_url=registry_ui_url ~ '#/admin/reactors', cta_label="OPEN WATCHTOWER" %}{% include '_partials/cta_button.html' %}{% endwith %}
{% with notice="This alert fires when canary path success rate drops below threshold. Check the Watchtower view for reactor health, then the receiver TEG. Investigation runbook: PRODUCTION_DOCS/06_OPERATIONS/Canary_Transfer_System.md." %}{% include '_partials/info_box.html' %}{% endwith %}
<p style="font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px;">CLI (Frame A; substitute your node's db container): <code>docker exec agentvault_registry_db_a psql -U postgres -d agentvault_registry_a -c "SELECT * FROM canary_test_results WHERE outcome='failed' ORDER BY fired_at DESC LIMIT 10"</code></p>
{% endblock %}
